      "title": "👑 Pixaroma - Note - START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load Checkpoint\n### Download **z-image-turbo-fp8-aio.safetensors** ~10GB from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/SeeSee21/Z-Image-Turbo-AIO/resolve/main/z-image-turbo-fp8-aio.safetensors?download=true)\n\n### Or \n\n### Download **z-image-turbo-bf16-aio.safetensors** ~20 GB from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/SeeSee21/Z-Image-Turbo-AIO/resolve/main/z-image-turbo-bf16-aio.safetensors?download=true)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/z-image` \n\nCreate the `z-image` folder if it does not exist)\n \nMore info about the AIO models [HERE](https://huggingface.co/SeeSee21/Z-Image-Turbo-AIO)\n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- None\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n"
